    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45728" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφηλ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>nail on</i>, in 
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Apollod.
				<u>Poliorc.</u>
				158.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.Mech.
				25.3
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶνδ᾽ ἐφήλωται τορῶς
				γόμφος διαμπάξ</span> the bolt is <i>driven home</i>, i.
			e. it <i>is irrevocably fixed</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				944
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφαλόω</span>.</div>
